OL,3,GNEWSABlasts heard as crews battle
OL,4,Aindustrial unit fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FExplosions have been heard and a huge
OL,7,Fplume of smoke can be seen at the scene
OL,8,Fof a large fire at an industrial unit.
OL,10,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,11,Fwas called to the site on Emery Road in
OL,12,Fthe Brislington area of Bristol at
OL,13,F14:27 BST. Firefighters from nine
OL,14,Fdifferent stations across Bristol,
OL,15,FNorth Somerset and South
OL,16,FGloucestershire were at the scene at
OL,17,Fits height.
OL,19,FThe BBC understands the roof of the
OL,20,Fbuilding on fire has collapsed,
OL,21,Falthough the blaze is now under
OL,22,Fcontrol.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
