OL,3,GNEWSABlasts heard as crews battle
OL,4,Aindustrial unit fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the fire service
OL,7,Fsaid: "We are asking residents and
OL,8,Flocal businesses to keep their windows
OL,9,Fand doors closed and avoid the area
OL,10,Fwhere possible."
